# env.optional — enrichment / fallback only; the skill runs without these.
# Deeper G2/Capterra/Reddit scraping when the Playwright renderer is blocked:
APIFY_API_TOKEN
# Structured SERP for the review/ad/social discovery searches (site:g2.com / site:reddit.com).
# If set -> paid SERP (DataForSEO or Serper); if not -> the agent's own web search (default):
DATAFORSEO_LOGIN
DATAFORSEO_PASSWORD
SERPER_API_KEY
# Bring-your-own-key synthesis instead of the platform-default model (usually unset):
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
OPENAI_API_KEY
